From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FAROVITUS <farovitus@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:26:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ssp: keep the unused StrongBox code out of the build

The ssp directory holds Samsung's StrongBox keymaster code, which my
device does not use and which does not build in a Lineage 22.2 tree.
An empty .find-ignore makes the build's file finder skip the directory,
so none of its Android.bp or Android.mk files are read. Every Lineage
22.2 zeroflte ROM I built had this file; it only lived in the build tree
until now.

Signed-off-by: FAROVITUS <farovitus@gmail.com>
---
 ssp/.find-ignore | 0
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ssp/.find-ignore

diff --git a/ssp/.find-ignore b/ssp/.find-ignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
-- 
2.50.1

